== Biography

I received my Ph.D. from Cornell University in 2024, advised by Prof. [http://people.csail.mit.edu/delimitrou/ Christina Delimitrou]. 
My research focuses on improving the performance and efficiency of cloud and machine learning systems. I was a research intern at Google Brain in 2021 and at Meta in 2022 and 2024.

Before joining Cornell, I obtained my B.S. degree from Shanghai Jiao Tong University. 

I am currently a software engineer at Google DeepMind, working on Gemini serving performance.

== Education

